<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 11.5 points to 912.4 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 11.5 points to 912.4 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 11.5 points on Friday to 912.4, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the energy index rising most, up 27.4 points to 1,113.8.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
